The model is

\[
\dot N=S(N)-qEN,
\]

\[
\dot Z=[\Phi_k(qEN-S(N))-Z]/\tau_m,
\]

\[
\dot E
=\left(1-\frac E{E_{max}}\right)
\left[
\eta E\left(\frac{Z(t-\tau)}{\Delta_{ref}}-rac E{E_{max}}\right)
+\delta_0\frac{Z(t-\tau)}{Z_{ref}+Z(t-\tau)}
